<title>USA: Abbott to buy Fact Plus pregnancy test.</title>
<headline>Abbott to buy Fact Plus pregnancy test.</headline>
<dateline>ABBOTT PARK, Ill. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abbott Laboratories Inc said Thursday it agreed to buy the Fact Plus brand of consumer pregnancy tests from Johnson &amp; Johnson.</p>
<p>Abbott, which developed technology in the Fact Plus test, said it would make a one-time payment to Johnson &amp; Johnson in exchange for the exclusive worldwide ownership of the Fact Plus trademarks and copyrights.</p>
<p>Other terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>-- ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
